        "TileImage": "$($repository b942c2a5-99e5-46a7-a2b1-017ae56864cf).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Your destintation is Cuba. Your targets are two soviet officers. Cilas Netzke and Edward Evdokimov. They are involved in a secret plan to get Jasper Knight, an American chessmaster and Soviet spy to Russia by an undetectable fighter jet.The US government has learnt about this and they can&apos;t afford their secrets to be access by Soviets and so contracted the ICA to eliminate both targets. Eliminate any targets as cleanly as possible, avoiding collateral damage as far as possible.",
